  "metadata": {
    "title": "Schwarz vessel + helix (two-scale gate)",
    "description": "De Jongh screw inside a flowing vessel, magnetically driven, solved with the coupled inertial-FVM \u2297 confined-Stokes-BEM two-scale solver. Proves a usable finite-Re, flow-rate-aware, confined simulator (the assumptions ar4_helical_drive omits). Differential counter-flow drag only; absolute drag non-physical (self-wake blocker). Primary validity Re \u2272 25, \u03bb \u2264 0.8.\n",
